          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "வருகை (varukai) is built on varu-, the stem of வா, \"to come\", with the noun ending -kai; DEDR 5270 gathers the family, including வரவு, \"coming, income\"."
            }
